          "longDescription": "Elicit's MCP server gives AI assistants direct access to a corpus of over 125 million academic papers. Search for relevant literature using natural language queries, create structured reports that extract and synthesize data across papers, and retrieve detailed report results — all programmatically. Built for life sciences R&D workflows, the server enables agents to rapidly survey evidence, compare findings across studies, and surface key data points without manual literature review, accelerating everything from target discovery to systematic evidence assessment.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "Elicit 的 MCP 服务器使人工智能助手能够直接访问包含超过 1.25 亿篇学术论文的语料库。使用自然语言查询搜索相关文献，创建结构化报告来提取和综合论文中的数据，并检索详细的报告结果——所有这些都以编程方式进行。该服务器专为生命科学研发工作流程而构建，使代理能够快速调查证据、比较研究结果并显示关键数据点，而无需手动查阅文献，从而加速从目标发现到系统证据评估的一切。",
