          "developerName": "Undermind AI, Inc.",
          "longDescription": "Undermind is your AI co-researcher for the scientific literature. Ask a research question and Undermind searches the literature for you. It follows citation trails, evaluates hundreds of papers, and comes back with a ranked reading list rather than a page of keyword matches.\n\nWith Undermind you can:\n\n- Run deep literature searches. Undermind's search agents explore a research question for a few minutes, then report back with a summary and a ranked list of relevant papers.\n\n- Look up papers by topic, author, title, DOI, or citation relationships (papers citing or cited by a paper you know), with abstracts and citation metrics.\n\n- Ask questions about a paper's full text, including its figures, tables, and equations, and check the answers against the source.\n\n- Keep your work organized in workspaces with folders, starred papers, saved searches, and notes, all synced with your account at undermind.ai.\n\nScientists at thousands of research institutions use Undermind, from university labs to pharma R&D teams. Use it to check whether an idea is new, get oriented in an unfamiliar field, or track down the one method paper you need.\n\nYou'll need an Undermind account (free or paid) and to sign in when connecting.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "Undermind 是您的科学文献人工智能联合研究员。提出一个研究问题，Undermind 会为您搜索文献。它跟踪引文轨迹，评估数百篇论文，并返回一个排名阅读列表，而不是一页关键字匹配。\n\n通过 Undermind，您可以：\n\n- 进行深入的文献检索。 Undermind 的搜索代理会探索一个研究问题几分钟，然后报告摘要和相关论文的排名列表。\n\n- 按主题、作者、标题、DOI 或引用关系（引用或被您认识的论文引用的论文）查找论文，并附有摘要和引用指标。\n\n- 提出有关论文全文的问题，包括其图形、表格和方程，并根据来源检查答案。\n\n- 通过文件夹、加星标的论文、保存的搜索和笔记在工作区中整理您的工作，所有这些都与您在 undermind.ai 上的帐户同步。\n\n从大学实验室到制药研发团队，数千个研究机构的科学家都在使用 Undermind。用它来检查一个想法是否是新的，在不熟悉的领域进行定位，或者找到您需要的单一方法论文。\n\n您需要一个 Undermind 帐户（免费或付费）并在连接时登录。",
          "productIntro": "Undermind 是一款服务，主要帮助你查找并阅读相关研究论文。 官方说明还提到：Undermind 是您的科学文献人工智能联合研究员。在 Codex 中，它适合在需要读取该服务信息、调用其能力或把结果带回当前任务时使用。",
