          "longDescription": "Connect ChatGPT to your Tamarind Bio workspace for protein and molecular science. Validate, estimate, submit, and monitor jobs across 300+ tools — structure prediction, docking, protein and antibody design, molecular dynamics, and property prediction. Chain tools into pipelines, batch many inputs at once, and pull back structures, results, and logs — all from chat.",
