          "longDescription": "Explore a new way to discover music and podcasts, with recommendations picked just for you. \nWant music to power your next run, study session, or party? Just ask and Spotify will drop the right songs, artists or playlists into your conversation. \n\nWith Spotify in ChatGPT you can:\n- Ask for songs, artists, genres, or playlists and play them in Spotify.\n- Find podcasts for any topic you are exploring.\n- Spotify Premium listeners can describe a vibe and get a playlist made to match.\n- Get recommendations based on your history right in your chat.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "探索发现音乐和播客的新方式，并为您精选推荐。 \n希望音乐为您的下一次跑步、学习或聚会提供动力吗？只需提出要求，Spotify 就会将合适的歌曲、艺术家或播放列表添加到您的对话中。 \n\n通过 ChatGPT 中的 Spotify，您可以：\n- 询问歌曲、艺术家、流派或播放列表并在 Spotify 中播放。\n- 查找您正在探索的任何主题的播客。\n- Spotify Premium 听众可以描述一种氛围并获得匹配的播放列表。\n- 在聊天中根据您的历史记录获取建议。",
