          "longDescription": "Piano 1024 is a playable synth piano inside ChatGPT. Learn songs phrase by phrase with fingering and hands-separate practice; build chord progressions and melodies you refine across the conversation; hear and name any chord; keep a metronome in any meter; and train your ear with graded interval, chord, and scale drills. Every note is synthesized live on the in-chat keyboard — tap to play, no samples or setup. Part of the 1024 family of music tools.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "Piano 1024 是 ChatGPT 中可演奏的合成钢琴。通过指法和双手练习逐句学习歌曲；构建您在对话中完善的和弦进行和旋律；听到并说出任何和弦；保持任何节拍的节拍器；通过分级音程、和弦和音阶训练来训练你的耳朵。每个音符都是在聊天键盘上实时合成的 - 点击即可播放，无需样本或设置。 1024 音乐工具系列的一部分。",
