          "longDescription": "TriAstra creates personalized birth charts and natal horoscopes in ChatGPT across three traditions: Western astrology, Vedic astrology (Jyotish/Kundli), and Korean Saju (Korean Four Pillars/Myeongri).\n\nEnter your birth date, birth time, and birthplace, then choose the tradition you want to explore. The interactive result highlights the placements and patterns that matter most in your chart and explains the calculation behind them in plain language. If your birth time is unknown, TriAstra keeps the reading to what can still be calculated reliably and leaves out houses, angles, and other time-dependent conclusions. For Saju, biological sex is used only to determine the traditional Daeun direction.\n\nWestern and Vedic charts use Swiss Ephemeris astronomical data; Saju follows Korean Myeongri principles. TriAstra is designed for individual natal readings rather than daily forecasts or relationship matching. Results are for reflection and entertainment and are not medical, legal, financial, or other professional advice.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "TriAstra 在 ChatGPT 中创建了跨越三种传统的个性化出生图和本命星座：西方占星学、吠陀占星学 (Jyotish/Kundli) 和韩国 Saju (韩国四柱/明里)。\n\n输入您的出生日期、出生时间和出生地，然后选择您想要探索的传统。交互式结果突出显示了图表中最重要的位置和模式，并用简单的语言解释了它们背后的计算。如果您的出生时间未知，TriAstra 会将读数保留为仍然可以可靠计算的值，并忽略房屋、角度和其他与时间相关的结论。对于 Saju 来说，生物性别仅用于确定传统的 Daeun 方向。\n\n西方和吠陀图表使用瑞士星历表天文数据； Saju 遵循韩国明里原则。 TriAstra 专为个人出生读数而设计，而不是每日预测或关系匹配。结果仅供思考和娱乐，并非医疗、法律、财务或其他专业建议。",
